    {
      "blockId": "tour:itinerary_text:173cf987634ed90a",
      "field": "itinerary.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "b617459dc32555e374787aadacbfcf21c43f3bf362a0e53d1cfd21f8eba1e5a3",
      "text": "Day 13 · A boat ride among the Isletas of Granada, some 365 islets formed by an ancient eruption of Mombacho Volcano, enjoying the flora, fauna and tranquil lifestyle of Lake Nicaragua, with a chance to see monkeys. Arrive at the private island of Zopango, facing Mombacho Volcano: swim, explore, birdwatch or relax in a hammock, and enjoy a lunch of freshly grilled local fish. Return to your hotel. Overnight at Hotel Real La Merced. (B, L)",
      "provenance": {
